(HR-14  Parental leave) Tj
T*
(Eligible employees receive 16 weeks of maternity leave. Eligible employees) Tj
T*
(receive 10 working days of paternity leave, to be taken within 60 days of) Tj
T*
(the child's birth. Eligible employees who adopt a child receive 4 weeks of) Tj
T*
(adoption leave. Leave is paid at the employee's base salary. Requests go) Tj
T*
(to People Operations at least 30 days in advance when the date is known.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(HR-07  Expenses) Tj
T*
(Meals under 75 USD may be submitted without a receipt if paid on a company) Tj
T*
(card. Meals of 75 USD or more require an itemised receipt. Alcohol is not) Tj
T*
(reimbursable. Submit expense reports within 30 days of the purchase.) Tj
T*
(Travel over 400 USD needs manager pre-approval.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(HR-03  Paid time off) Tj
T*
(Full-time employees receive 20 days of paid time off per calendar year,) Tj
T*
(accrued monthly. A maximum of 5 unused days may be carried into the next) Tj
T*
(year. Requests of 3 or more consecutive days must be submitted at least) Tj
T*
(7 days in advance. Sick leave is tracked separately and is not deducted) Tj
T*
(from the 20-day balance.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(IT-11  Laptops and devices) Tj
T*
(Customer data may be stored only on a company-issued laptop. Personal) Tj
T*
(devices used for work email must be enrolled in mobile device management.) Tj
T*
(A lost or stolen laptop must be reported to IT within 4 hours.) Tj
T*
(Employees may not install unapproved remote-access software.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(SEC-02  Data handling) Tj
T*
(Customer personal data must not be pasted into Slack, personal email, or) Tj
T*
(unapproved AI tools. Production access is granted only through a ticket) Tj
T*
(and is revoked on the day an employee leaves. Secrets belong in the) Tj
T*
(company vault, not in git.) Tj
